ty-intro">Community</a><span>/</span><a class="transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white rounded-sm" href="/guides">Guides</a></div><article><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-6 sm:flex-col sm:items-stretch sm:gap-4"><div class="max-w-xl 2xl:max-w-[520px]"><h1 class="text-[36px] leading-tight font-medium tracking-tighter text-balance md:text-[28px]">Getting started with Neon Auth and Neon Data API using React</h1><p class="mt-[1.125rem] text-xl leading-tight tracking-extra-tight text-gray-new-40 dark:text-gray-new-70 md:mt-1.5 md:text-lg">Build a Todo app using React, Neon Auth, and the Neon Data API</p></div><div class="relative mt-2.5 w-fit sm:mt-0"><div class="flex items-center border border-gray-new-90 dark:border-gray-new-20"><button class="flex h-8 w-fit shrink-0 items-center gap-2 border-r border-gray-new-90 px-2.5 whitespace-nowrap text-black-new hover:bg-gray-new-98 dark:border-gray-new-20 dark:text-gray-new-94 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="size-4 shrink-0"><g clip-path="url(#copy-docs_inline_svg__a)"><mask id="copy-docs_inline_svg__b" width="16" height="16" x="0" y="0" maskUnits="userSpaceOnUse" style="mask-type:luminance"><path fill="#fff" d="M0 0h16v16H0z"></path></mask><g stroke="currentColor" mask="url(#copy-docs_inline_svg__b)"><path d="M5.947 14.63h8.683V5.945H5.947z"></path><path d="M3.579 10.684H2V2h8.683v1.579"></path></g></g><defs><clipPath id="copy-docs_inline_svg__a"><path fill="#fff" d="M0 0h16v16H0z"></path></clipPath></defs></svg><span class="text-sm leading-none tracking-extra-tight whitespace-nowrap">Copy page</span></button><button class="flex h-8 items-center px-1 hover:bg-gray-new-98 dark:hover:bg-gray-new-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="15" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 15" class="size-3.5 text-gray-new-50 transition-transform duration-200 dark:text-gray-new-50"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" d="M3.5 5.75 7 9.25l3.5-3.5"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="prose-doc post-content prose dark:prose-invert xs:prose-code:break-words mt-10 lg:mt-7 md:mt-5"><p>This guide will walk you through building a secure Todo application using <strong>React</strong>, <a class="" href="/docs/auth/overview">Neon Auth</a>, and the <a class="" href="/docs/data-api/overview">Neon Data API</a>.</p>
<p>By the end of this tutorial, you’ll have a fully functional Todo app that allows users to sign up, log in, and manage their todos. Authentication is handled through Neon Auth, while secure data access is powered by the Neon Data API. The app does not require any backend server; all interactions happen directly between the React frontend and the Neon database.</p>
<p>This architecture keeps things simple yet secure, with all the complexities of authentication and data access managed by Neon.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Identity managed in the database:</strong> User accounts and sessions are stored within the <code>neon_auth</code> schema.</li>
<li><strong>Direct and secure data access:</strong> The React frontend communicates with the database through the Data API, eliminating the need for a backend.</li>
<li><strong>Row-Level Security (RLS) in action:</strong> Policies ensure that each user can only view and modify their own todos.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="prerequisites" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Prerequisites</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#prerequisites" aria-label="Link to Prerequisites"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>Before you begin, ensure you have the following:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Node.js:</strong> Version <code>18</code> or later installed on your machine. You can download it from <a class="group inline" href="https://nodejs.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">nodejs.org<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a>.</li>
<li><strong>Neon account:</strong> A free Neon account. If you don&#x27;t have one, sign up at <a class="group inline" href="https://console.neon.tech/signup" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Neon<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a>.</li>
</ul>
<ol class="numbered-steps mt-6! inline-flex w-full flex-col pl-0!" style="counter-reset:section"><li class="numbered-step relative mt-8! mb-0! flex w-full items-start gap-4 pl-0! before:flex before:size-7 before:items-center before:justify-center before:rounded-full before:bg-gray-new-20 before:text-center before:font-mono before:text-sm before:leading-snug before:font-medium before:tracking-tight before:text-white before:content-[counter(section)] before:[counter-increment:section] after:absolute after:top-8 after:-bottom-7 after:left-[.8125rem] after:w-px after:bg-gray-new-90 first:mt-0! last:after:bottom-0 dark:before:bg-gray-new-90 dark:before:text-black-pure dark:after:bg-gray-new-30 [&amp;_h2]:text-2xl [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal!"><div class="w-[calc(100%-100px)] flex-1 [&amp;&gt;*_*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:pt-0 md:[&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0"><h2 id="create-a-neon-project-with-neon-auth-and-data-api" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>Create a Neon project with Neon Auth and Data API</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#create-a-neon-project-with-neon-auth-and-data-api" aria-label="Link to Create a Neon project with Neon Auth and Data API"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2><p>You&#x27;ll need to create a Neon project and enable both Neon Auth and the Data API.</p><ol>
<li>
<p><strong>Create a Neon project:</strong> Navigate to <a class="group inline" href="https://console.neon.tech" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Neon Console<span class="whitespace-nowrap no-underline"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="ml-1 inline-block size-3.5! shrink-0 align-[-0.125em]"><path fill="currentColor" d="M0 0h14v14H0z" opacity="0.2"></path><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" d="M9.915 8.885V4.08H5.11M9.625 4.375 4.083 9.917"></path></svg></span></a> to create a new Neon project. Give your project a name, such as <code>react-neon-todo</code>.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Enable Neon Data API with Neon Auth:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>In your project&#x27;s dashboard, go to the <strong>Data API</strong> page from the sidebar.</li>
<li>Ensure <strong>Use Neon Auth</strong> is selected.</li>
<li>Ensure <strong>Grant public schema access</strong> is enabled.</li>
<li>Finally, click on the <strong>Enable Data API</strong> button to activate the Data API with Neon Auth.</li>
</ul>
<p><span aria-owns="rmiz-modal-" data-rmiz=""><span data-rmiz-content="not-found" style="visibility:visible"><img alt="Data API page with enable button" loading="lazy" width="704" height="447" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent;width:100%;height:100%" src="/docs/data-api/data_api_sidebar_with_public_schema.png?dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7"/></span></span></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Copy your credentials:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Data API URL:</strong> Found on the Data API page (e.g., <code>https://ep-xxx.neon.tech/neondb/rest/v1</code>).
<span aria-owns="rmiz-modal-" data-rmiz=""><span data-rmiz-content="not-found" style="visibility:visible"><img alt="Data API enabled view" loading="lazy" width="704" height="447" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent;width:100%;height:100%" src="/docs/data-api/data-api-enabled.png?dpl=dpl_3oQTwA9tDsjxX7vtodZE2SLAZ1X7"/></span></span></p>
</li>
